    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "The temperature in °C inside a hut at Thredbo is given by the expression $t^{2}-13t+36$, where $t$ is hours after 1 pm.\nFind the times in the day when the temperature is 0°C.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "5 pm and 10 pm.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}t^{2}-13t+36&=0\\\\(t-4)(t-9)&=0\\\\t&=4\\text{ or }9\\end{align*}$$\nThe temperature is 0°C at 5 pm and 10 pm.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
